hint_tooltip = "GUITAR PATTERN EDIT FIELD

You can set a pattern of 16 steps using:

D : Down Strum Chord
d : Down Strum Chord Light
U : Up Strum Chord
u : Up Strum Chord Light
F : Flam (fast down-up)
f : Flam Light

X : Muted Chord
x : Muted Chord Light
W : Double Mute
w : Double Mute Light

B : Main Bass note
b : Main Bass note Light

[Point] : Let ring
[Space] : Silence

0, 1, 2, 3, 4 : Single note for arpeggio.
->  4 is the 1st not muted string (the highest pitch)

if the chord has less than 5 notes,
0 and 1 will play the same lowest pitch string

"
